                                "sense_id": "4f19b1a4-a128-3bde-a8ea-ebdca888c1c0",
                                "text": "Ulrike lived in a farm hof, and all around me were the dark blank fields punctuated by a few disparate lights."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "baf82833-0612-482e-a4d9-32484fd4b194",
                                "sense_id": "4f19b1a4-a128-3bde-a8ea-ebdca888c1c0",
                                "text": "Like many old houses, this one had a front section, where I lived, and at the back an interior courtyard, the Hof, enclosed on all three sides by more apartments."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
